	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Laundry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[折板码巾 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "折板码巾">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Partner Bakery 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "morning" or Time.dayState is "day">>烘焙坊早市刚出炉的甜点台前，<<else>>烘焙坊准备下午茶点心的操作台旁，<</if>>同班烘焙工正在给一批杏仁牛角包刷蛋液，请你搭手撒上烤香的杏仁薄片。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回烘焙坊 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_bakery_3 is 1>>
那批杏仁牛角包今日已全部烘烤出炉，酥脆金黄的香气飘满长街。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-job-partner-bakery-3">
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<mpcookicon>><<link "撒杏仁片 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-bakery-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_bakery_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_bakery_3")>><<money 1520>>烘出的牛角包金黄酥脆、杏仁满覆，一上架便被抢购一空，你也分到了提成。<<else>>出炉的牛角包金黄酥脆、杏仁片满覆，麦香飘满了整条后巷。<</if>><span class="green">你与烘焙工默契配合烤出了招牌牛角包。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续看火 (0:04)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	烤盘边缘尚带余温，轻触时烫了一下小指。<span class="red">你戴好隔热手套准备继续撒片。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Bakery 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><<mpcookicon>><<link [[撒杏仁片 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撒杏仁片">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<link "补匀蛋液 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-bakery-3">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_bakery_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_bakery_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>每一只牛角包都烤出了漂亮的琥珀色光泽，面包师傅乐呵呵地给你加发了老字号信物铜牌。<<else>>每一只牛角包都烤出了漂亮的琥珀色光泽，表皮酥脆掉渣。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">均匀细腻的蛋液让整炉点心色泽完美。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[请师傅品鉴 (0:04)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	软毛刷蘸多了蛋液，滴在烤盘纸上。<span class="red">你刮去多余蛋液擦净烤盘纸。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Bakery 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[补匀蛋液 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "补匀蛋液">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "舞蹈等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Partner Tailor 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "dusk" or Time.dayState is "night">>裁缝铺晚间交活前夕，<<else>>裁缝铺安静的熨衣台旁，<</if>>同班绣娘正在给一件丝绸晚礼服锁边，请你帮忙将裙摆内侧的铅坠配重链一一定位缝牢。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回裁缝铺 (0:03)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_tailor_3 is 1>>
丝绸晚礼服裙摆的配重链今日已全部缝妥，垂坠弧度优雅自然。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-job-partner-tailor-3">
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 240>><<mptailoricon>><<link "钉配重链 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-tailor-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_tailor_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_tailor_3")>><<money 1520>>裙摆自然垂落如流水般顺滑，绣娘欢喜地与你平分了加急制衣红利。<<else>>银丝配重缝入衬底后，礼服裙摆自然垂落如流水般顺滑。<</if>><span class="green">精准定位的配重链让礼服垂感绝佳。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpsewicon>><<link [[继续缝制 (0:04)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	细缝衣针穿过铅链孔时滑了一下，轻刺指尖。<span class="red">你吮了口指尖戴稳顶针再缝。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Tailor 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><<mptailoricon>><<link [[钉配重链 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "钉配重链">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link "绒裹铅链 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-partner-tailor-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJob3_mp_job_partner_tailor_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job3_rew_mp_job_partner_tailor_3_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>包上丝绒的配重链走动时毫无摩擦声响，莫奈看后当场多批了一笔手工奖。<<else>>包上丝绒条的配重链服帖隐蔽，走动时听不见半点金属摩擦声。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">包裹丝绒的巧思让晚礼服尽显高定水准。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[请师傅查验 (0:04)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	丝绒包带裁得窄了一分，包裹链条时有些紧绷。<span class="red">你换一条宽包带准备重新包裹。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Job Partner Tailor 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[绒裹铅链 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "绒裹铅链">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
